.Dd September 28, 2026
.Dt BLUES 1
.Os Blueshift
.Sh NAME
.Nm blues
.Nd archive Bluesky posts to a GitHub repository
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl c Ar path
.Op Fl e
.Op Fl i Ar text
.Op Fl l Ar number
.Op Fl q
.Op Fl s Ar date
.Op Fl u
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
fetches posts from Bluesky, converts them to Markdown with YAML frontmatter,
and uploads them to a GitHub repository.
Replies and posts beginning with
.Sq @
are excluded.
Reposts and quote posts are excluded unless enabled in the configuration.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl c , Fl -config Ar path
Read the EDN configuration from
.Ar path
instead of
.Pa config.edn .
.It Fl e , Fl -echo
Print generated Markdown.
.It Fl i , Fl -ignore Ar text
Ignore posts containing
.Ar text .
May be given more than once.
.It Fl l , Fl -limit Ar number
Fetch at most
.Ar number
posts.
.It Fl q , Fl -quiet
Suppress progress output.
.It Fl s , Fl -since Ar date
Fetch posts after
.Ar date .
Accepts an ISO 8601 date or timestamp, or a
.Dq YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS
timestamp.
Dates without a time begin at midnight in the local timezone.
.It Fl u , Fl -update
Set
.Li :last-fetch
to the current time.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show usage information.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
The default configuration file is
.Pa config.edn
in the current working directory.
It is an EDN map with
.Li :bluesky
and
.Li :github
maps containing credentials and repository information.
See
.Pa config.example.edn
for a complete example.
The file contains secrets and should not be committed.
.Pp
The optional
.Li :ignore
vector filters posts containing any listed text.
.Li :repost?
and
.Li :quote-posts?
control whether those post types are included.
.Li :time-offset
and
.Li :date-format
control frontmatter timestamps.
.Li :last-fetch
is maintained by
.Nm
after successful uploads.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ./config.edn
Default configuration file.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Nm
exits 0 on success and 1 on an error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr wattle 1
